"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.5.beta.custom_build [7cc3f374a]\n- Has been happening since early 4.5 builds (I don't have a specific version/commit to point to)\n- I don't remember encountering this issue in 4.4.x\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta (7cc3f374a) - Manjaro Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Thu, 07 Aug 2025 04:47:58 +0000 on Wayland - Wayland display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 7900 XT (RADV NAVI31) - AMD Ryzen 9 7900X 12-Core Processor (24 threads) - 30.49 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhile using the editor (Wayland version), at some point, seemingly randomly (this can happen right after opening the project, or much later), renaming nodes in the scene tree or files in the filesystem dock will fail entirely: I can edit the name and type anything I want, but pressing <kbd>Enter</kbd> does not validate the change, while pressing <kbd>Esc</kbd> or clicking outside of the edited name does cancel as expected.\nThe issue persists until the editor is restarted.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nTry renaming nodes or files until you can't... (in some instances, the very first rename after opening the project works, and the second rename fails). See the following video.\n\nIt would appear that moving the mouse cursor over and out of the edited item is what triggers the issue.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ce903bca-a7fe-4e00-80d5-45d55f26d311\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nNo MRP to share as the issue isn't clearly reproducible, but I do have a Wayland debug log of one occurrence where the second rename failed.\n\n[rename_issue_log.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21911161/rename_issue_log.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109817/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109817/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}